 "\n\t\n\t\[EmptySmallCircle] Ya tenemos una idea gr\[AAcute]fica de c\
\[OAcute]mo se comportan estas energ\[IAcute]as, \[DownQuestion]pero c\
\[OAcute]mo determinamos num\[EAcute]ricamente esas intersecciones? \n\t \t\
\[Bullet] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["F", "par"], "(", "\[Eta]", ")"}], "   ", 
    StyleBox["y",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "   ", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["F", "impar"], "(", "\[Eta]", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"86dd6ea3-2efe-a44a-ae0b-fcbe381ddcaf"],
 " son no lineales. No parece sencillo encontrar sus ceros. \n\t\t\[Bullet] \
No obstante, la sustituci\[OAcute]n intermedia ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "=", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["sin", "2"], "\[CurlyPhi]"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"240c60e4-db37-5741-bd4d-e62d3bcdd4a0"],
 "  (con ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", "\[CurlyPhi]", "\[LessEqual]", 
    FractionBox["\[Pi]", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a2af2fa5-c056-2144-ac74-7631d23d3d67"],
 ") es de mucha ayuda: \n\t\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\t", GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{"      ", 
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["f", "par"], "(", "\[CurlyPhi]", ")"}]}], "=", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["F", "par"], "(", 
        RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "\[Rule]", 
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["sin", "2"], "\[CurlyPhi]"}]}], ")"}], "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"cos", "(", 
         RowBox[{"\[CurlyPhi]", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[ScriptC]", " ", 
           RowBox[{"sin", "(", "\[CurlyPhi]", ")"}]}]}], ")"}], ","}], " "},
      {
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["f", "impar"], 
        RowBox[{"(", "\[CurlyPhi]", ")"}]}], "=", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["F", "impar"], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "\[Rule]", 
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["sin", "2"], "\[CurlyPhi]"}]}], ")"}]}], "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sin", "(", 
         RowBox[{"\[CurlyPhi]", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[ScriptC]", " ", 
           RowBox[{"sin", "(", "\[CurlyPhi]", ")"}]}]}], ")"}], ","}], 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["       ",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], 
        RowBox[{
         StyleBox["y",
          FontSlant->"Plain"], " ", "ambas", " ", "son", " ", "m\[AAcute]s", " ",
          "f\[AAcute]ciles", " ", "de", " ", "trabajar", " ", 
         RowBox[{"as\[IAcute]", ".", " \t"}]}]}]}
     }], "   "}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a26246e7-0bfb-7145-8707-75983bd53772"],
 " \n\t\t\n\t\t\[Bullet] Los respectivos ceros de ambas funciones \
est\[AAcute]n en ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
