  FormBox[
   FractionBox["\[Pi]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d6187f3e-745e-2e44-86a8-f451f1262606"],
 ".\n\t\t\t\[Dash] Por lo mismo, no se debe confundir ",
